{"id":"0e5b54aafbcf6fc4","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-omega-complete.md","title":"Omega Complete","display":"df-omega-complete — Omega Complete","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-omega-complete","aliases":["92-df-omega-complete"],"display":"df-omega-complete — Omega Complete","depends_on":["[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-substitution]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]"],"source":"本地数码实例和相容性定义；对照原书第 V 章 pp.60–64；这里采用固定 PA 语言，不能直接替换成原书抽象系统的参数","source_status":"原书相容性概念的本地展开"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-omega-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-omega-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega-complete — Omega Complete"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地数码实例和相容性定义；对照原书第 V 章 pp.60–64；这里采用固定 PA 语言，不能直接替换成原书抽象系统的参数"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相容性概念的本地展开"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (variable-symbol set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> (provability relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (substitution, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (free-variable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}(G)\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}(G)\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}complete}\\vdash\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\,\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(G\\vdash\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,x))\n\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}complete}\\vdash\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\,\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(G\\vdash\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,x))\n\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}(G)\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}(G)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>完备的</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>完备系统满足<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>规则</li>\n<li>如果对每个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>都证明无捕获代入所得实例<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,x)\\)</span>，则证明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,\\varphi\">\\(\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>完备与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性不同</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span>禁止同时证明某个存在断言及其所有逐项否定，强于普通一致性；它不只是“没有矛盾”的改写</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}(G)\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Complete}(G)\\)</span>表示对<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>规则闭合，而不是普通有限归纳模式的同义词</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"725c1f1651ce9a00","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formula set, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},